    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forefront of cutting edge rabbit simulation technology in gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City Rabbit 9: Aerotic CIty is a third person shooter roguelite starring the titular City Rabbit: Rabbit Ros\u00e9 and his Angel(?) friend Ananiel. They live in a strange city called Aero, which is full of dangerous monsters, hazardous tornadoes, strange people, and most importantly, has no exits to be found. Follow them on their dastardly plan to escape by... what is their plan exactly...? Who knows? But by the time you've started playing, they're already 99.5 percent done with their plan, so it must be going well, right?...RIGHT?!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fast paced combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Over 50 unique monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dozens of items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Custom OST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Difficult bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-10 skills to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Realistic rabbit simulation technology(TM)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-At least 1 rabbit(TM)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A story(?)</p>",
